L,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',0,1,1,'2022-01-30 04:18:50',0,'2024-08-24 22:19:54'),(17,'Terms And Conditions','terms-and-conditions',NULL,'<p>Health Box &ndash; Return &amp; Replacement Policy</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At Health Box, customer satisfaction is our highest priority. We follow strict hygiene and quality standards to ensure you receive the freshest and safest seafood. However, in rare cases where an issue arises, we provide a simple and fair Return &amp; Replacement Policy:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>✅ Applicable Conditions:</p>\r\n<p>If your delivered item is damaged, spoiled, or incorrect, you must report it within 30 minutes of delivery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Please provide photo/video proof via WhatsApp or Messenger at the time of delivery or immediately after.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Returns are only accepted during delivery. Once you accept the product, it is considered final due to the perishable nature of seafood.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For courier deliveries outside Dhaka, we do not offer returns, but we may provide a partial refund or store credit if the issue is valid and reported immediately with proper proof.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,0.00,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,0.00,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',0,1,1,'2022-01-31 03:31:57',0,'2025-09-08 12:54:12'),(60,'লালমরিচগুঁড়ো (Red Chili Powder)','lalmricgunndo-red-chili-powder','প্রাকৃতিক, হোম-মেড, কোনোকৃত্রিমরঙবাএডিটিভনেই\r\n সেরামানেরলালমরিচথেকেপ্রস্তুত।','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"BN\">প্রাকৃতিক</span>,&nbsp;<span lang=\"BN\">হোম</span>-<span lang=\"BN\">মেড</span>,&nbsp;<span lang=\"BN\">কোনোকৃত্রিমরঙবাএডিটিভনেই</span><span lang=\"HI\">।</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"BN\">সেরামানেরলালমরিচথেকেপ